---
import FigureShell from '../FigureShell.astro'

/** Eager launches versus one CUDA Graph replay; a shape sketch, not a measurement. */
const rows = [
  { label: 'Eager', cells: ['gap', 'kernel', 'gap', 'kernel', 'gap', 'kernel', 'gap', 'kernel'] },
  { label: 'Graph replay', cells: ['gap', 'graph', 'dependency', 'graph', 'dependency', 'graph', 'dependency', 'graph'] },
]
const tone: Record<string, string> = { gap: 'bg-accent2', kernel: 'bg-info', graph: 'bg-accent', dependency: 'border border-dashed border-rule-strong bg-sunken' }
---
<FigureShell label="eager 与 CUDA Graph 的发射时间线" padded>
  <div class="grid gap-2" role="img" aria-label="eager 逐个提交 kernel；graph 一次提交已捕获的依赖图，设备依赖与执行仍存在">
    {rows.map((row) => (
      <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)] items-center gap-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-1">
        <b class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">{row.label}</b>
        <div class="grid h-7 grid-cols-8 gap-0.5">
          {row.cells.map((cell) => <span class:list={['rounded-xs', tone[cell]]} />)}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    橙色表示 CPU 提交，蓝色与绿色表示设备 kernel，虚线格表示仍需满足的设备依赖。Graph 减少逐 kernel 的主机提交，不保证消除全部设备空档；格宽只用于表达顺序，不代表实测时长。
  </Fragment>
</FigureShell>
